  - Source: THE FIELD
  - Target: THE KNOLL
  - Description: The field is near the knoll where enemies are positioned, part of the landscape
  - Source: THE FIELD
  - Target: THE EASTERN WALL
  - Description: Heywood runs along the eastern wall toward the field, showing a connection
  - Source: THE FIELD
  - Target: THE CREST
  - Description: The crest is the top of the field where Fang sits, part of the same area</data>
