      <data key="d2">extracted</data>
      <data key="d3">Harry is a highwayman who resides in a hidden valley and is known as a "shot," meaning a highly skilled shooter. He is the primary target of Brice's quest, and is also suspected of involvement in a robbery. Despite this, Harry has acted square (honestly or fairly) toward Yuba Bill, and is currently being pursued by a posse. Harry is also a relative of Hiram and Mrs. Tarbox—likely a son or nephew—who visits them occasionally on off nights when the coach is not running. He is the only one who knows the way to Flora's home, but he is not present at the time of the narrative.
