  - Description: MISS WEBB has experienced a strained and problematic relationship with her L.W.A. (likely an organization or association, possibly related to franchise operations). Specifically, her difficulties with the L.W.A. center on issues of franchise support, indicating that the challenges she faces are tied to the level or quality of assistance provided by the organization. The recurring mention of these difficulties suggests a persistent and unresolved tension between Miss Webb and the L.W.A., with the core problem revolving around inadequate or unsatisfactory support in her franchise-related dealings. This summary consolidates the available information, which consistently points to a single, coherent issue: Miss Webb’s ongoing struggles with the L.W.A. over franchise support, without any contradictory details.</data>
