  - Target: POET
  - Description: The poet is considering turning to Tragedy, which represents a more serious literary form, as he deliberates on his next work.
  - Source: ELEGY
  - Target: POET
  - Description: The poet is currently engaged with Elegy, as he considers what work his Muse should commence, and Elegy represents his current love poetry.</data>
