      <data key="d10">1.0</data>
      <data key="d11">TOTO and WOODMOUSE are connected through a wedding event, where TOTO is a guest and WOODMOUSE is the host. At this wedding, WOODMOUSE extends an invitation to TOTO, which TOTO accepts. In response to the invitation, TOTO offers to provide music for the occasion, indicating a collaborative and friendly interaction. During the event, WOODMOUSE excuses himself to attend to the ceremony, a gesture that demonstrates respect toward TOTO. Their relationship is thus defined by mutual courtesy and a shared role in the wedding's proceedings, with TOTO contributing musically and WOODMOUSE managing the host duties.</data>
      <data key="d12">WOODMOUSE</data>
    </edge>
