      <data key="d9">related_to</data>
      <data key="d10">1.0</data>
      <data key="d11">TOTO and WOODCHUCK share a close friendship, as the woodchuck is one of Toto's summer playmates. However, the woodchuck is notably absent from their usual circle during the winter months due to hibernation. Despite this seasonal gap, the two are firmly bonded, having spent a winter together as part of a larger group of friends. Their relationship is marked by mutual affection, and they exchange farewellsthough the woodchuck is less vocal than Toto. Toto's cottage serves as a central meeting place, and it is there that the woodchuck once became trapped and was subsequently freed, with Toto hosting the gathering. This incident underscores the trust and care between them, as Toto provides a safe haven and actively facilitates the woodchuck's release. Together, these details paint a picture of a warm, enduring friendship that persists across seasons, with Toto acting as a hospitable host and the woodchuck as a quieter but loyal companion.</data>
      <data key="d12">TOTO</data>
    </edge>
