      <data key="d8">MONTAGU TRIXIT</data>
      <data key="d9">related_to</data>
      <data key="d10">1.0</data>
      <data key="d11">MASTERTON is a representative sent by his directors to deliver a message to MONTAGU TRIXIT, with whom he is actively seeking a meeting. Mastertons primary objective is to negotiate with Trixit regarding securities, a matter of significant importance to his superiors. Notably, Masterton is described as the only man who genuinely wishes to meet Trixit, who is characterized as a fugitive. This unique desire to encounter Trixit suggests that Masterton holds a particular interest or purpose in the negotiation, possibly driven by professional duty or personal conviction. The interaction between the two centers on the exchange of a message and the discussion of securities, indicating a formal or business-related context. Masterton acts as an intermediary, tasked with conveying his directors intentions and reaching an agreement with Trixit, despite the latters fugitive status. The relationship is thus defined by a professional negotiation, with Mastertons willingness to meet Trixit setting him apart from others who may avoid the fugitive. Overall, the summary highlights Mastertons role as a negotiator and messenger, his deliberate pursuit of Trixit, and the focus on securities in their dealings.</data>
      <data key="d12">MONTAGU TRIXIT</data>
    </edge>
