      <data key="d8">THE HAWK</data>
      <data key="d9">related_to</data>
      <data key="d10">1.0</data>
      <data key="d11">The hawk initially sees Pigeon Pretty as prey, but after being shown kindness, he looks at her with a strange look, indicating a shift in perception. Pigeon Pretty is chased by the hawk, but later pleads for the hawk's release, showing compassion and forgiveness.</data>
      <data key="d12">THE HAWK</data>
