      <data key="d11">The hawk submits to the hermit's kindness, sitting on his knee and allowing his plumage to be stroked, indicating a bond of gratitude. The hermit offers the hawk food and shelter, and the hawk accepts, showing a relationship of trust and mercy.</data>
